        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Camera Move Contact Sheet\n\n**Camera Move Contact Sheet** renders the same starting frame across a list of camera movements in one batch.\n\n1. **Camera Moves** lists the six presets to audition; **ForEach** steps through each move.\n2. **Template** combines the move name with your **Scene Notes** and sends each prompt to **ImageToVideo**.\n3. **Collect** gathers all rendered takes into a list for side-by-side comparison."
        },
